!--- 14. Convergence: T / Ne / impurities ---
! FIX_T=T / FIX_X_DPTH=0: temperature held on the hydro profile at all depths.
! This is the correct approach when T(r) comes from HERACLES/STELLA hydro output.
! Ne allowed to vary (FIX_NE=F) so electron density converges self-consistently in NLTE.
! FIX_NE=T is available via --fix_ne / vadat_overrides to stabilise first-iteration populations.
F               [FIX_NE] ! Ne free - CMFGEN solves Ne from charge conservation
F               [FIX_IMP]      ! Impurity populations free (init profile: F; was T)
T               [FIX_T]  ! hold T at the hydro profile at all depths
F               [FIX_T_AUTO]   ! No auto-release of T
