T               [DO_NG]        ! enable Ng acceleration of the Lambda iteration
1.0D1           [BEG_NG] ! start Ng acceleration when max % change falls below this
20              [IBEG_NG] ! minimum iterations before first Ng acceleration
40              [BW_NG]  ! depths per Ng acceleration band
8               [ITS/NG] ! run Ng every N-th iteration

